      "text": "adding or poursing stylesheet to the \nhtml document.  \n\ncharacteristics :                  \n> It is used to make website attractive.\n> It enchances the user's experience.\n> It is developed by Hakon wium lie.\n> It is a language that is used to describe the style of a document.\nCSS 1 --> 1996\nCSS 2 --> 1998\nCSS 3 --> 1998,1999,2011 -->  released in the form of modules\nCSS 4 --> 2014 (not released yet production)\n\n\nWays of adding CSS",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "adding or poursing stylesheet to the \nhtml document.  \n\ncharacteristics :                  \n> It is used to make website attractive.\n> It enchances the user's experience.\n> It is developed by Hakon wium lie.\n> It is a language that is used to describe the style of a document.\nCSS 1 --> 1996\nCSS 2 --> 1998\nCSS 3 --> 1998,1999,2011 -->  released in the form of modules\nCSS 4 --> 2014 (not released yet production)\n\n\nWays of adding CSS",
